.getByLabel('Name bearbeiten', { exact: true })).toBeFocused();\n    }\n  }""]",browser,SC:FE:expense-mutations.spec.ts:69e95fe1cf1e,[],"[""3.4/AC-9""]","[""actual browser accessibility or journey boundary"", ""session/UI/input/response-order""]","[""Actual browser DOM/keyboard/focus/announcements/reflow/HTTP wiring for this stated path; pure state/format/input variants may be supplemented by isolated components.""]","[""Gleiche UI-Regel/Eingabe bei Anlage und Bearbeitung wird einmal gezählt; konkrete Editor-/HTTP-/Fokuspfade bleiben als ergänzende Nachweise erhalten.""]"
